<p>Using previous program experience. From Scarlet (Gimbaled 2024-2025) the mass of the gimbal was ~200 grams, but increased to ~800 grams on HPRTVC. Seeing as the architecture of Gimbaled TVC (Being low powered) matches Scarlet, but has greater restrictions (Accuracy, Speed, etc..) the mass is taken from Scarlet, with increased tolerance to allow for improved design.</p>
